The installer, daily role selector, managed instructions, and verification
runtime are implemented in this repository. No other agent-orchestration
project is bundled or required for installation or execution.

The Python runtime uses only the Python 3.11+ standard library and invokes
the official Codex CLI for client capabilities and model execution.
